1
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,240
In front of the goal... there, right?

2
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,120
Here it comes...! A perfect cross.

3
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,830
Wait... No... Is this another pass to Rin?

4
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,580
No...! It's for me.

5
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,040
...Bastard.

6
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:29,750
Shidou?

7
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,210
What are you doing?!

8
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,680
~I'll take it gladly.

9
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:33,970
Let's hit them on the counter, Otoya!

10
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:35,340
You finish it, Karasu.

11
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:38,050
Is there no straight man in your double act?

12
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,890
~Then allow me to deliver the punchline.

13
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,770
...Damn... They're closing in on the win.

14
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,340
...What a disaster!

15
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,940
But why did they crash into each other?!

16
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,740
That ball was mine!

17
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:55,950
You berserk antenna freak!

18
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:57,740
You annoying lower-eyelash bastard!

19
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,490
You're an eyesore!

20
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:01,470
Don't get so full of yourself!

21
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:07,590
...Is it because Rin reads the field data and analyzes it to get into the best position in front of goal?

22
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:10,210
No...! It's for me!

23
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:13,720
While Shidou positions himself there purely on instinct?

24
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:19,110
They reached the same vision, but their methods were so different they couldn't link up!

25
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:25,440
Could they be the least compatible duo among the top six?

26
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:31,800
...Wait a minute!

27
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:41,740
Isn't this a piece... that I can use...?

28
00:03:20,290 --> 00:03:23,190
Hey hey hey hey! Cut it out.

29
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:27,060
...Both of them only play blood football for their own goals.

30
00:03:28,460 --> 00:03:32,610
...That's why they're sitting at the top of this place.

31
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:39,760
Can those two even co-exist on the same team...?

32
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:45,140
I'll really kill you if you do that again, Rin-chan.

33
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:49,370
Come and try it then, you insect.

34
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:53,120
...No... It's impossible for them to get along.

35
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:26,290
Don't do this, guys!!

36
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,670
...In this situation, the only thing I can do to help this team...

37
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,800
Is to help Rin and Shidou link up?!

38
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:05,520
...Anyway... If we concede one more goal, the match is over.

39
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,840
...I have no other choice.

40
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,060
...And to prove myself...

41
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:15,850
...I can't fail!

42
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:22,490
It's clear nothing works except these quick passes.

43
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,450
Come on. Pass it if you're a man.

44
00:04:25,450 --> 00:04:28,350
...Otoya...! Damn...! He's making it hard for us.

45
00:04:28,350 --> 00:04:29,410
Hiori! Deep!

46
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:31,840
Use me!

47
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:32,920
Isagi-kun?

48
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:35,420
~You're running into really great spots.

49
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:38,620
~But you won't escape my surveillance... Mr. Average.

50
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:40,690
...Damn it.

51
00:04:40,690 --> 00:04:42,330
...He's really persistent.

52
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:47,290
...In the end, unless I break through Karasu's mark... I'll stay as ineffective as I am now.

53
00:04:47,290 --> 00:04:48,430
...In that case.

54
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:50,890
What if I position myself here?

55
00:04:54,330 --> 00:04:55,350
Nanase...?

56
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:58,360
...Rin-kun and Shidou-san's movements...

57
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:07,310
...come from an extraordinary genius, and I can't predict them at all.

58
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:13,370
...But your movements, Isagi-san... I can predict.

59
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:15,540
...This kid...

60
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:18,870
...He's reading my movements to support Rin.

61
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:21,760
...Then he's making off-the-ball runs near me to support me.

62
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,510
...Nice! This will work.

63
00:05:25,410 --> 00:05:26,720
There, right?

64
00:05:27,450 --> 00:05:29,260
...He shifted his attention to Nanase.

65
00:05:29,740 --> 00:05:32,390
...I'll take advantage of that and slip into his blind spot.

66
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,560
From here, right?!

67
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,670
...Shut up! And I'm going again.

68
00:05:35,670 --> 00:05:37,730
He's going to use his hand! Dodge it, Isagi-san!

69
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,190
...I'll get past him.

70
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:41,150
...And receive the through ball.

71
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,070
We broke through!

72
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:50,030
...I see it...! The picture is expanding...! I can see the path to the goal.

73
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:53,130
...I'm a little far to shoot.

74
00:05:53,130 --> 00:05:54,830
...Also, Chigiri is between me and the goal.

75
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,710
...But Rin is coming.

76
00:05:57,230 --> 00:06:00,200
...If I can pass it to him accurately, he'll score.

77
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:04,760
...But Otoya being there makes it difficult.

78
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:06,730
Isagi Yoichi!

79
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,350
Shidou?

80
00:06:08,350 --> 00:06:10,130
...But his back is to the goal.

81
00:06:10,980 --> 00:06:12,110
...I get it.

82
00:06:12,670 --> 00:06:18,440
I'll give him the first pass and run into the open space... then he'll give me the second... and with that we bypass Chigiri and I'll have space to shoot.

83
00:06:19,050 --> 00:06:21,150
Alright! Let's go, Shidou!

84
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:24,440
This will be... our own chemical reaction.

85
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,280
~What a wonderful assist.

86
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:31,370
He turned on the spot...?

87
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,960
~~Tada!

88
00:06:37,890 --> 00:06:40,790
A super-spinning banana shot?!

89
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:50,080
...Thanks to his polished physique... and his terrifyingly quick shots...

90
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:53,550
...He's invincible inside the penalty area!

91
00:06:53,550 --> 00:06:56,810
~I'm the strongest inside the penalty area.

92
00:06:57,950 --> 00:07:01,090
...I realized it was naive to expect a pass from him.

93
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,970
Incredible! He's a real monster.

94
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:12,300
...But... thanks to his presence, my options expanded, and this goal resulted from that.

95
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:15,440
You already got an assist, Isagi-san!

96
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:20,410
Thank you, Nanase.

97
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,540
You're welcome!

98
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,890
You're the only one I can keep up with, Isagi-san.

99
00:07:25,890 --> 00:07:27,500
So use me however you like.

100
00:07:28,290 --> 00:07:30,870
...Gradually, a new combination started to form for me.

101
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:33,340
...And I can enter the flow of the game more.

102
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,600
You got it... Let's go.

103
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:41,600
...All that's left... is to score.

104
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:45,300
...Isagi Yoichi has started to get active.

105
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:47,070
...How annoying.

106
00:07:47,690 --> 00:07:50,780
...It'll be over if he scores...! I have to steal the ball.

107
00:07:51,470 --> 00:07:56,580
...I'll get past you again... and write the end to this match, Mr. Average.

108
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:00,790
You can't handle him, Isagi.

109
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:04,950
Is what you do best preying on the weak, you hyena Karasu?

110
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,670
Stop picking at dead meat and come at me.

111
00:08:07,670 --> 00:08:13,380
~I hate this overbearing attitude. ~I'll sue you for abuse of power, you bastard.

112
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:14,970
...Those two...

113
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:18,180
...They're treating me like I don't exist!

114
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:32,360
...He raised his elbow just in time to prevent me from controlling the distance between us.

115
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:35,000
...How impressive, Itoshi Rin.

116
00:08:35,370 --> 00:08:38,950
...Whatever... I'll give up on the idea of getting past him and just pass.

117
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:41,370
...I'll pull back... to keep possession for us.

118
00:08:43,850 --> 00:08:45,870
Mr. Average?! Did you pounce on the ball from my blind spot?!

119
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,090
Great! I stole it!

120
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:49,590
Great job, Isagi-san!

121
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:51,090
I'm ready here!

122
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:54,800
...Nanase and Hiori reacted to my moves.

123
00:08:55,570 --> 00:08:57,010
...Time for the counterattack!

124
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:00,780
~Hello~ The road is blocked.

125
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:03,070
...Otoya quickly returned to defense.

126
00:09:03,070 --> 00:09:03,770
...But.

127
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:05,020
Isagi-san!

128
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,750
Here we go!

129
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,400
...Nanase is moving near me to support me.

130
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:15,640
...And Hiori is building the attack for us with his high-level passing skills.

131
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:18,060
...Before the other team's players can get back.

132
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:22,080
We'll break through them from the center!

133
00:09:22,530 --> 00:09:24,410
Whoa! That was close!

134
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:27,150
...He's not very skilled, but...

135
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:28,130
Pass, Nanase!

136
00:09:28,130 --> 00:09:29,080
Got it!

137
00:09:29,890 --> 00:09:32,340
...If I switch the play to the other side at this timing...

138
00:09:33,810 --> 00:09:35,510
Hiori will be completely free!

139
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:37,970
~Great, great.

140
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:42,200
Watch where you're going, sky-blue hair!

141
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:47,440
You really are very fast! No wonder you caught Karasu's eye!

142
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:50,930
...Before Chigiri closes down the distance between them...

143
00:09:50,930 --> 00:09:54,790
Hiori will decide whether to pass it to someone in a good shooting position or just to someone who's available.

144
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:56,280
And then he'll see Shidou!

145
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,610
~One pass in front of the goal for the goal machine.

146
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:03,340
...And just like the last attack... Shidou will approach Hiori to get the ball.

147
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:07,570
...And at that moment, an empty space will open up behind him!

148
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:15,050
And that will be my shooting zone, one that surpasses even Shidou!

149
00:10:15,470 --> 00:10:16,510
Here it comes.

150
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,430
Huh? Did he ignore me...?

151
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:24,070
Here it comes! Exactly as I envisioned!

152
00:10:24,070 --> 00:10:25,640
You're amazing, Hiori!

153
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,920
...The final piece.

154
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,520
Right there!

155
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,990
...Damn...! I was one step short.

156
00:10:41,250 --> 00:10:42,500
...Even though I saw it...

157
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:44,370
...Even though I understood it...

158
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,670
...My physical abilities...

159
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,040
...prevented me from reaching it!

160
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:51,500
Excuse me.

161
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,710
~I'll clear it away.

162
00:10:52,710 --> 00:10:53,750
No! Not yet!

163
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:55,340
It's a loose ball!

164
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,550
And Rin and Karasu are fighting for it!

165
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:01,510
This is why dealing with genius opponents is so annoying!

166
00:11:01,510 --> 00:11:04,220
Then get the hell away from me, you damn crow!

167
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:04,900
Stop him!

168
00:11:04,900 --> 00:11:05,510
Shoot!

169
00:11:06,590 --> 00:11:08,210
...Rin will do it.

170
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:11,650
...That last step I couldn't reach.

171
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,400
He will reach it!

172
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,780
Awesome! We tied!

173
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:29,250
...You held me in place so the shot wouldn't go off target.

174
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:30,960
...Nice one, genius.

175
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,920
You really are a talkative crow.

176
00:11:35,830 --> 00:11:42,210
...Ever since that mediocre guy got active... you're a completely different team.

177
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,850
This pisses me off!

178
00:11:45,610 --> 00:11:52,520
The three of us managed to prove ourselves and link up with Rin and Shidou.

179
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:54,480
...But.

180
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,330
Dominate them!

181
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:02,740
For you, the Top 6 are not just teammates you play alongside.

182
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,370
...This isn't...

183
00:12:07,690 --> 00:12:10,150
...the football I want to play!

184
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:13,370
You were one step away from scoring, Isagi-kun.

185
00:12:14,570 --> 00:12:17,040
Hiori... Your pass was wonderful.

186
00:12:17,330 --> 00:12:20,660
I had no choice but to put the ball there at that moment.

187
00:12:20,660 --> 00:12:21,700
Sorry.

188
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:25,140
Don't apologize, it was perfect.

189
00:12:25,790 --> 00:12:28,140
...It matched my imagination and analysis exactly.

190
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:32,550
...But... Damn it, my physical abilities didn't allow me to reach the ball.

191
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:37,690
...My thinking was correct... but my body couldn't keep up.

192
00:12:40,650 --> 00:12:44,110
If you think and then move, you'll always be behind.

193
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:48,610
...See, think, then move.

194
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:52,540
...It might have worked in your battles so far, but...

195
00:12:53,290 --> 00:12:58,060
...If you're trying to steal a goal from Rin-kun and Shidou-kun, it's a different story.

196
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:01,360
...With your weak physical abilities...

197
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:06,200
Even if you envision things as fast as their play... you'll always be one step behind.

198
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:09,390
...What are you saying? Are you saying there's nothing I can do?

199
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:12,770
Why don't you... try being instinctive?

200
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:16,990
Then the world you feel might change.

201
00:13:21,190 --> 00:13:24,070
Awesome! Whoever scores the next goal wins!

202
00:13:24,070 --> 00:13:25,700
~~I'll score that goal.

203
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,700
Stop barking, you trash.

204
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:31,660
I'm done with you, genius.

205
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:32,950
Let's go, Otoya!

206
00:13:33,170 --> 00:13:34,660
Got it~ Quick passes.

207
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:38,460
Hoping to steal it like last time?!

208
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:40,210
~Too bad for you, Mr. Average.

209
00:13:41,290 --> 00:13:45,270
I was targeting the space you left behind, you fool!

210
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:48,390
~Break through them... Red.

211
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,260
Chigiri?!

212
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,350
Damn!

213
00:13:51,610 --> 00:13:54,020
He's completely free on the right wing!

214
00:14:03,060 --> 00:14:05,110
The star player has arrived!

215
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,360
Great job, Shidou-san!

216
00:14:08,970 --> 00:14:10,080
...Next...

217
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,400
I'll score the winning goal!

218
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:20,250
Get the second ball!

219
00:14:21,710 --> 00:14:25,420
Okay! You want it there, right?! Isagi-san!

220
00:14:26,770 --> 00:14:28,170
Nice, Nanase!

221
00:14:29,740 --> 00:14:30,640
Here I go.

222
00:14:30,930 --> 00:14:33,010
This is my last chance.

223
00:14:33,690 --> 00:14:36,220
...Even if I reach a vision that surpasses Rin and Shidou...

224
00:14:36,470 --> 00:14:40,310
...I won't be able to reach it with my current physical abilities.

225
00:14:40,990 --> 00:14:43,910
Why don't you try being instinctive?

226
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:48,650
But what does doing the opposite even mean...?

227
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:54,870
...My style is... see, think, then move.

228
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,700
That's why it works as a weapon.

229
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,870
...As for doing it instinctively...

230
00:15:01,590 --> 00:15:04,500
Can a human even do that...?

231
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:07,210
You're getting way too carried away, Mr. Average.

232
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:09,180
I'll kill you forever.

233
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:13,130
...This guy only shows up in the most annoying places.

234
00:15:13,130 --> 00:15:13,840
Isagi!

235
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,180
Pass to me!

236
00:15:16,860 --> 00:15:18,910
Rin is trying to link up with me...?

237
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:21,730
...And Nanase came too.

238
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:27,440
With this triangle... we can break through Karasu and Otoya!

239
00:15:27,670 --> 00:15:28,490
Rin-kun!

240
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:29,530
Let's raise our rhythm!

241
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,490
...We're bypassing them with these intense, quick passes.

242
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:35,660
...And behind that.

243
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:37,080
Go, Hiori!

244
00:15:37,690 --> 00:15:39,660
...Crush them from the left wing!

245
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,230
You'll have to step over my dead body to get past me!

246
00:15:41,230 --> 00:15:42,620
Show me what you've got, sky-blue!

247
00:15:43,630 --> 00:15:46,340
You really are a thorn in the side.

248
00:15:46,730 --> 00:15:48,170
...I'm counting on you, Hiori.

249
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:53,230
When you're about to cross... Rin and Shidou will charge into the penalty area trying to reach it!

250
00:15:56,140 --> 00:16:01,310
The one who can win this intense battle in front of the goal... will be the one to score!

251
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:07,790
...Even if I target the space left by Rin and Shidou...

252
00:16:07,790 --> 00:16:11,040
...My body won't let me reach the ball like last time.

253
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:14,030
...In that case, which zone...

254
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:17,740
Should I position myself in...?

255
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:18,910
The space behind Shidou...?

256
00:16:20,570 --> 00:16:21,460
...No.

257
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:25,570
Maybe in Rin's blind spot...?

258
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:27,250
Enough!

259
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,840
Am I an idiot or what?!

260
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:33,680
Didn't we say see and think is too slow?!

261
00:16:34,810 --> 00:16:36,530
...Don't think with your head!

262
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:40,420
...Just move according to your instincts!

263
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,280
...Believe.

264
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:46,350
...And all of your ability,

265
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:49,280
...all of your cells,

266
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:53,320
...all of your senses...

267
00:16:55,070 --> 00:16:59,700
...Reflect them... in that moment!!!

268
00:17:14,210 --> 00:17:15,470
Isagi Yoichi...?

269
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:17,800
How...?

270
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,120
The match is over!

271
00:17:46,380 --> 00:17:48,580
Score: 5-4.

272
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:52,550
Isagi-san!!! You were amazing!

273
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,590
Victory goes to Team A!

274
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:56,840
That was a truly incredible goal!

275
00:17:57,430 --> 00:18:04,030
You were really far from Rin-kun and Shidou-san, but you surpassed both of them and scored with a direct shot!

276
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:07,100
How did you do it?!! It was truly like a miracle!

277
00:18:07,100 --> 00:18:09,940
...To be honest, even I don't know.

278
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:13,440
...But... I tried to apply what Hiori told me.

279
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:18,950
...I left it to my instincts... and my body just ran there on its own.

280
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:20,820
What exactly is that?!

281
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:22,830
A new skill?! An awakening?

282
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:24,620
I'm so buzzed!

283
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,600
...I get it, so please step back.

284
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,580
I'm so sorry!

285
00:18:28,970 --> 00:18:31,180
Well done, Isagi Yoichi!

286
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:34,300
I can feel my cells igniting.

287
00:18:36,250 --> 00:18:39,990
I might fall in love with your explosion.

288
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:43,640
...Incredible goal, he says.

289
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:47,480
...You don't even know how you got to the shooting point.

290
00:18:48,110 --> 00:18:50,320
...You stole my goal through pure luck.

291
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:54,100
...Isagi... you really piss me off.

292
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:01,570
...That goal.

293
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:04,870
...I still don't understand how I scored it.

294
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:07,880
...But I'm sure of one thing... and that is...

295
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:10,830
That I surpassed Rin and Shidou in that moment!

296
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,550
...The state of being completely immersed in the challenge you're facing...

297
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,390
...Flow.

298
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:32,150
You've touched the way miracles are made... Isagi Yoichi.

299
00:21:06,690 --> 00:21:08,910
...C team's third player.

300
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:13,900
Mikage Reo.

301
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:18,340
...Finally.

302
00:21:19,370 --> 00:21:22,590
...I've arrived at a place where I can fight beside you again.

303
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:24,600
...Nagi.

304
00:21:30,270 --> 00:21:31,330
Our turn.

305
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:34,750
Shall we go... Nagi Seishiro?

306
00:21:40,570 --> 00:21:42,150
Okay, glasses guy.

307
00:21:45,180 --> 00:21:47,010
Let's do this...?

308
00:21:51,650 --> 00:21:54,950
Blue Lock: Additional Time!

309
00:21:57,920 --> 00:22:01,960
Tell me, Otoya, are you really descended from ninjas?

310
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:04,040
~Yep~ Nin nin.

311
00:22:04,550 --> 00:22:06,570
Can you do ninjutsu techniques?

312
00:22:06,570 --> 00:22:07,880
Yep, wanna see?

313
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,760
Are you serious?! Of course I do!

314
00:22:12,380 --> 00:22:14,140
...Ninpo.

315
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:18,810
~Tongue summoning.

316
00:22:18,810 --> 00:22:22,650
Gross! That's not how it's done.

317
00:22:23,100 --> 00:22:24,930
What are you two doing?!

318
00:22:24,930 --> 00:22:28,790
Ninpo: Flirting with girls. ~Works on most of them.

319
00:22:29,230 --> 00:22:30,910
I'm an idiot for asking.

320
00:22:30,910 --> 00:22:35,410
Easy there, ladies... You're a guy, right? I've got techniques that suit you too.

321
00:22:35,410 --> 00:22:38,460
I doubt it... It's probably equally stupid.

322
00:22:38,460 --> 00:22:41,080
It's one of those techniques often used in anime and manga!

323
00:22:41,080 --> 00:22:42,870
Like the ones that blow fire or air?!

324
00:22:42,870 --> 00:22:45,460
I'll teach you this secret technique, ladies.

325
00:22:45,460 --> 00:22:47,880
You'll definitely need it in the future.

326
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,830
Really?

327
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:50,470
...Really really.

328
00:22:52,890 --> 00:22:54,540
That sounds kind of awesome!

329
00:22:55,100 --> 00:22:56,560
Sounds stupid.

330
00:22:56,560 --> 00:22:57,560
...Ninpo.

331
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:59,280
~Back hug.

332
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:00,560
...Oh, get lost.

333
00:23:01,820 --> 00:23:03,070
Head pat.

334
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:05,210
Do you want me to humiliate you?!

335
00:23:05,730 --> 00:23:07,240
The art of combining techniques!

336
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:10,600
Ninpo: Chin-lift and whisper!

337
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:12,500
~Genius-chan.

338
00:23:14,380 --> 00:23:17,260
Anyway, ninja arts are essential for flirting.

339
00:23:17,260 --> 00:23:21,530
Deceive and be deceived... test each other... win her heart and confuse her.

340
00:23:22,970 --> 00:23:27,070
Never let her discover your true nature... That is the secret of the ninja arts!

341
00:23:27,690 --> 00:23:29,840
These are just pick-up arts, man!

342
00:23:29,840 --> 00:23:31,650
You selfish playboy!

343
00:23:31,980 --> 00:23:33,530
~Caught me.

344
00:23:33,530 --> 00:23:36,000
For the record, I'm not interested in men.

345
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,890
...And now repeat after me!

346
00:23:37,890 --> 00:23:41,460
Girls are the best! Nin nin!

347
00:23:41,460 --> 00:23:42,750
Pervert ninja.

348
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:44,550
...May your ancestors scold you.